'''Nylocas, On the Rocks''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to freeze any 4 [[nylocas]] with a single [[Ice Barrage]] spell during a [[Theatre of Blood/Entry Mode|Theatre of Blood: Entry Mode]] raid. As the achievement is completed immediately after freezing 4 nylocas, the raid does not need to be completed.

==Strategy==
The easiest way to complete this achievement is to wait until at least halfway through the Nylocas encounter. When there are enough Nylocas stacked around a pillar, casting Ice barrage on the group will likely complete the achievement. 

During Maiden, in groups of 2 or more, there is a chance that the South 4,5 and North 4,5 [[Nylocas Matomenos|Matomenos]] will all spawn. They will clump together after a few seconds and can be frozen in unison, easily completing the achievement.

